<title>USA: Kellogg splits stock, boosts dividend rate.</title>
<headline>Kellogg splits stock, boosts dividend rate.</headline>
<dateline>BATTLE CREEK, Mich. 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kellogg Co said Friday its directors  approved a two-for-one stock split effective August 22 to shareholders  of record on August 8.</p>
<p>Kellogg also said its board approved a post-split increase in its  quarterly dividend to $0.225 per share from $0.21 (equivalent to a  pre-split increase to $0.45 per share from $0.42). The dividend is  payable September 15 to shareholders of record on August 29.</p>
<p>		     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
